Project a corrupted blast of power that removes up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] magical or physical effects or any type of sustain and deals [71, 96, 115, 131, 145 (TL1-5; SP 100)] blight damage to any creatures caught in the radius 3 ball.

For each effect, the creature has a chance to resist based on its spell save.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
